---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";
---

<Layout
    seo={{
        title: "Proyectos — Inmaculada Osuna",
        description: "Tesis de máster y grado, proyectos de ingeniería de datos y divulgación científica.",
    }}
>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 py-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto antialiased">
        <div>
            <a href="/es/" class="text-sm font-semibold text-rose-500 hover:text-rose-600 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"></path></svg>
                Volver al Inicio
            </a>
        </div>

        <header class="flex flex-col gap-3">
            <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-900 dark:text-white">
                Proyectos y Tesis
            </h1>
            <p class="text-lg text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                Una recopilación de investigación académica, TFMs, TFG y soluciones aplicadas de ciencia de datos.
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6">
            <!-- DYNAMIC PRICING -->
            <a href="/es/projects/dynamic-pricing" class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 hover:border-rose-300 dark:hover:border-rose-700 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-rose-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col gap-3 group cursor-pointer">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 text-xl group-hover:text-rose-500 transition-colors">Sistema Inteligente de Dynamic Pricing</h3>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-600 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-full dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">TFM — UCM</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Motor de optimización de capacidad en el transporte interurbano usando Deep Reinforcement Learning (PySpark y Streamlit).
                </p>
            </a>

            <!-- INFLUENCERS -->
            <a href="/es/projects/influencers" class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 hover:border-orange-300 dark:hover:border-orange-700 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-orange-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col gap-3 group cursor-pointer">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 text-xl group-hover:text-orange-500 transition-colors">Análisis de Influencers Virtuales</h3>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-600 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-full dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">TFM — UGR</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Análisis cuantitativo del impacto y percepción de influencers virtuales mediante modelado de ecuaciones estructurales (PLS-SEM) con SmartPLS y redactado en LaTeX.
                </p>
            </a>

            <!-- ALHAMBRA -->
            <a href="/es/projects/alhambra" class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 hover:border-rose-300 dark:hover:border-rose-700 transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-rose-500/10 hover:-translate-y-1 flex flex-col gap-3 group cursor-pointer">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 text-xl group-hover:text-rose-500 transition-colors">Geometría de la Alhambra</h3>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-neutral-600 bg-neutral-100 border border-neutral-200 rounded-full dark:bg-neutral-800 dark:text-neutral-300 dark:border-neutral-700">TFG — UGR</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
                    Modelado matemático de los 17 grupos cristalográficos de los mosaicos de la Alhambra, acompañado de una serie de vídeos divulgativos registrados.
                </p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>